${\mathsf{C o}}/{\mathsf{C o}}_{2}{\mathsf{P}}@{\mathsf{C}}$ Mott-Schottky electrocatalysts were successfully synthesized from Co-MOF and show excellent HER activity owing to the Mott-Schottky effect, synergy effect of Co and ${\mathsf{C o}}_{2}{\mathsf{P}}$ and porous carbon shell.
